          "en": "The boy grew quickly and has now become taller than his father."
        },
        {
          "mt": "Is-siġar taż-żebbuġ jikbru bil-mod iżda jgħixu sekli sħaħ.",
          "en": "Olive trees grow slowly but live for whole centuries."
        }
